    "PATTERN_RECTANGULAR": {
      "description": "Linear-grid replication of feature(s) along two independent direction vectors. Each axis has count, spacing, and a Total/Spacing/Curve-Length distribution. Optional orient-to-direction-1 forces all instances to face the same way.",
